&lt;h6 class="smt_head5" style="padding-left:31.5pt;padding-right:0pt;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;text-justify:inter-ideograph;text-indent:0pt;font-family:&amp;apos;ＭＳ 明朝&amp;apos;;text-align:justify;letter-spacing:0pt;line-height:14pt;font-size:9pt;"&gt;(2) 退職給付債務の期末残高と連結貸借対照表に計上された退職給付に係る負債の調整表&lt;/h6&gt;
&lt;div class="tbld" style="margin-left:50.5pt;margin-right:0pt;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;"&gt;
&lt;table cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" style="border-collapse:collapse;border:solid 0pt #000000;width:433.5pt;table-layout:fixed;"&gt;
&lt;colgroup&gt;
&lt;col style="width:219.5pt;min-width:219.5pt;"/&gt;
&lt;col style="width:107pt;min-width:107pt;"/&gt;
&lt;col style="width:107pt;min-width:107pt;"/&gt;
